{# ===========================================================================
   Component: location-place

   The neighborhood and the landmark, in prose. Section 1 of the location page
   template in SITE_ARCHITECTURE.md is "Hero. This room, this neighborhood",
   and until now the only geography on a location page was the street address
   inside the plate. A page that never says where it is in words leaves a
   search engine to infer it from a postal code, on a site whose Convoy
   citation audit already scored 25 out of 100.

   USAGE
     {% set place = roomPlaces[loc.id] %}
     {% include "components/location-place.njk" %}

   Copy lives in _data/roomPlaces.json, hand written per room from
   CLIENT_FACTS.md, with the sourcing rule recorded in that file. Renders
   nothing for a room with no entry, the same gate the gallery and the
   difference section use.

   NO ICON. The sprite has twelve marks and all twelve are food or the
   wordmark: there is no map, pin, or building. DESIGN_SYSTEM.md's rule is
   that where no icon matches the subject, the heading takes none, the same
   call the menu page's Dessert heading already makes.
   =========================================================================== #}
{%- set place = roomPlaces[loc.id] %}
{%- if place %}
<section class="sect sect--rule" aria-labelledby="place-title">
  <div class="sect__inner">
    <header class="sect__head">
      <h2 class="sect__title" id="place-title">{{ place.title | safe }}</h2>
    </header>
    <div class="place">
      {%- for para in place.body %}
      <p class="place__para">{{ para | safe }}</p>
      {%- endfor %}
      <p class="place__nap">
        {{ loc.address.street }}, {{ loc.address.locality }}, {{ loc.address.region }} {{ loc.address.postalCode }}.
        <a class="sect__link" href="{{ loc.phone | telHref }}">{{ loc.phone }}</a>.
        <a class="sect__link" href="{{ loc | mapsUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open in Maps<span class="u-visually-hidden">, opens in a new tab</span></a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif %}
